<title>USA: Edge Petroleum files for public offering.</title>
<headline>Edge Petroleum files for public offering.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edge Petroleum Corp said Friday it has filed for a initial public offering of two million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Edge filed for the initial public offering on December 4, 1996.</p>
<p>The net proceeds from the offering are to be used to eliminate debt and to fund the company's capital expenditure program.</p>
</text>
